    "value": "RS324 succeeded first-pass under DWF 0.1.72, completing only the three-archive Standard/Expression/Quantities GREEN and readying T2 Verification. RS325 independently copies ten canonical SDK/project/ledger/report/verifier inputs and exactly three immutable physically SHA-pinned nupkg archives to a short disposable working root. It invokes the existing RS322 physical validator against that copied NUGET_LOCAL feed, requires a clean pass, injects and refuses archive tampering, forged Standard version, RS254 first-pass history falsification and an unsupported claim that ten remaining packages are qualified, then revalidates each restored copy and canonical hash. RS323's separate net11.0 locked restore is established by durable evidence, not replayed. Activate T2 Verification only; no global package qualification, migration, publication or guidance upgrade.",
