      "Preserve original NuGet archives, production SDK 10.0.401/net10.0/C#14 and DWF guidance 0.26 under the separate BL0028/RS0 consumer upgrade hold."
    ],
    "nextAction": "Once RS325 independently verifies physical and provenance refusals, separately assess T2 Verification and C01 task closure strictly within the three-package evidence; retain other ten library gaps.",
